+	parsers introduced by myself on 2000-03-16: `#define yydebug 0'
+	was used in order to simplify:
+
+	#if YYDEBUG
+	if (yydebug)
+	{
+	...
+	}
+	#endif
+
+	into
+
+	if (yydebug)
+	{
+	...
+	}
+
+	unfortunately this leads to a CPP conflict when
