@@ -0,0 +1,87 @@
+/* hash - hashing table processing.
+   Copyright (C) 1998, 1999, 2001, 2003 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+   Written by Jim Meyering <meyering@ascend.com>, 1998.
+
